	(text "1 white-orange, 2 white-brown: +5V_HEAD\n3 orange, 4 brown, 5 green: GND\n6 blue pair: USB D+/D- (VBUS not carried)\n7 white-green: the touch line\n\nAt the frame: 1-2 from MP_Buck1, GND at the\nstar point, USB to the Pi with its VBUS open.\nAt the head: the blue pair to a USB-C plug\nbreakout on the Pro Micro (VBUS open there too)."
