	(text "+5V_TOOL: the coupling (sheet Toolhead). On only\nwhen the host says so (key locked, ID says \"power\nme\"); off at once, locally, when the ID line opens.\nR959 holds it off through a reset or crash.\nCheck: CTRL off when floating, on at 3.3 V."
