	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312.42 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "36ec234f-ef5e-4571-beb1-2f75874d33d9")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aeba649f-7abd-4914-8b7b-ca9b01bfb464")
	)
	(text "One 5 V for the board and the tool: MP_Buck1 at the frame,\n2 + 2 CAT6 wires (~0.08 R a metre, ~0.1 V at 1 A). The Pi's\nVBUS never reaches it. More than ~1.5 A: 9 V down, buck here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "80ccf07d-10f1-4a92-a98b-22d041b4a018")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2947c02-ccee-40e8-9a5d-905260ff0744")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed at the board: 4 wires. Sign and grams\non the bench. Ratiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+.\nNo NTC: the cell is below the steppers, nothing warm nearby."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d2550daf-0363-40a1-be45-3649cf944e3a")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8451edfd-13c2-4fec-855f-5df5170a2647")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing.\n+3V3_PH: the Pro Micro's regulator, from RAW (+5V_HEAD)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d4888a0-67bb-4b47-9461-f51bfbe31e20")
	)
	(text "THE TOOL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "952a8354-c3d3-4f80-818c-ac9770a49c09")
	)
	(text "GP26: the ID (later the link), GP27: its pull-up, GP9: the\ntool's 5 V. Data pins inputs until the tool has 5 V.\nKlipper keeps K and its lock switch (Melzi)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "294fd1fd-99e0-4274-9717-7ac40c3d6151")
	)
